d work bench, an old oak bureau, some vintage christening gowns and a wedding dress.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6ovtcwFa0IlRCXwEU6oqhYdIDTp.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-04-11\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 6\",\"overview\":\"Jacqui Joseph rescues an ornately carved cabinet, some antique furniture and a tired pair of bamboo chairs from the skips at Beaconsfield recycling centre in Buckinghamshire.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vhXqzCtC65UmK78wgQ28R9CJabY.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-04-16\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Episode 7\",\"overview\":\"Sarah Moore rescues a trio of vintage chairs, a set of Victorian-era doors and some old hanging baskets from the skips at Keynsham recycling centre in Somerset.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yna9QHyLgaURh0v2xsA6oQ3O55Y.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-04-18\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Bureau de Change\",\"overview\":\"Glam, bam, and hopefully, thank you ma’am... Jacqui Joseph saves a brown bureau and gives upcycler Sarah Parmenter the huge challenge of saving it.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zMyi4cDpRJJz1fIqDBsmOEUP9Pm.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-04-23\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"A Bright Spark\",\"overview\":\"One of the series' trickiest finds ever, a street lamp, arrives at the workshop of robot maker Mark. Can his brain find a spark of genius?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lolysselyrY7KFZU01OnG7gpFuU.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-04-25\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"A Sound Profit\",\"overview\":\"What is boxy, brown and sounds amazing? Audio engineer Horse tries to turn a kitchen cabinet into a banging Bluetooth speaker - but will it be a smash hit?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5JvQFX5UlDe2NkgnxQZedlU2Tnv.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-04-30\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Too Hot to Handle?\",\"overview\":\"Too Hot to Handle? Sarah risks getting her fingers burnt trying to turn candles into cash and opts for multi-coloured carrot designs to save the day!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/290ZxJPBqQcr5T6S4mFJDaOgD7R.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-05-02\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Bedknobs and... bookshelves?\",\"overview\":\"Some broken shelves pose a carpentry conundrum for woodworker Sam, and Jacqui Joseph tries to dream up a new look for an old headboard.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/67JXlwIOQqnF6kC0iBOM320MORh.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-05-07\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"No Pane, No Gain\",\"overview\":\"Blacksmith Kev 'smashes it’ with big profits produced from a glass table and Sarah gets her wires crossed trying to save a lamp stand.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qyTgubwGZp1UvtYvQ7DrvlQOBdI.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-05-09\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Born to Be Wild\",\"overview\":\"Clawed feet inspire upcycler Tristan to attempt a wild makeover – but will it be a roaring success?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l8gvFAXsva8hzT6XJ7ncc3SNS9o.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-05-14\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Sofa, So Good\",\"overview\":\"Upholsterer Simion falls in love with a super cool sofa frame, but it pushes him way out of his comfort zone – maybe love is blind!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bVkP8p2sasEAToHb44CZke8jrVt.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-05-16\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Anyone for Croquet?\",\"overview\":\"Lighting designer Guy needs to jump through hoops to somehow repurpose some old croquet sets, while Sarah needs a light touch with a delicate glass dome.\",\"st